{"id":"en_eliza-vance-on-the-run","title":"Eliza Vance on the Run","titleEn":"Eliza Vance on the Run","description":"Eliza Vance has spent years working tirelessly, driven by both her own ambition and the hopes her parents placed in her. Her dedication pays off when she earns a place at the university she has long dreamed of attending, and the whole family shares in the joy and pride of that achievement. Yet the happiness proves short-lived. Just as Eliza is preparing to begin this new chapter, an earthquake strikes her remote mountain village without warning, shattering its calm and upending the future she had worked so hard to build. The series follows the consequences of that sudden turning point, and viewers can follow Eliza Vance on the Run on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/eliza-vance-on-the-run/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/eliza-vance-on-the-run/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Strong-willed","Fallen Girl","Self-growth","Student","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deyas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_eliza-vance-on-the-run_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deyas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_eliza-vance-on-the-run_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deyas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_eliza-vance-on-the-run_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7deyas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_eliza-vance-on-the-run_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1